    "title": "关于学习习近平《在博鳌亚洲论坛2022年年会开幕式上的主旨演讲》的通知",
    "source": "流动党员支部",
    "publishDate": "2022-04-22",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">各位党员：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px\">　　<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">根椐流动党员支部学习计划，本周学习内容：习近平总书记《在博鳌亚洲论坛2022年年会开幕式上的主旨演讲》。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px\">　　<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">学习形式：自学，各位党员要记好学习笔记。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px\">　　<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">特此通知。<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">流动党员支部</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">2022</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">年4月22日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n                ",
